{45}{Being cursed with a lack of style, the cretin chooses to lock himself away inside his house. But then, what would you expect from a half ogre? We've had agents watch his house for hours on end and never see him set foot out of doors, yet during those times he has been spotted about town. Very curious. His house is in south Boil, but I wouldn't recommend a direct assault.}{Being cursed with a lack of style, the cretin chooses to lock himself away inside his house. But then, what would you expect from a half ogre? We've had agents watch his house for hours on end and never see him set foot out of doors, yet during those times he has been spotted about town. Very curious. His house is in south Boil, but I wouldn't recommend a direct assault.}{}{}{}{}
{47}{How do I get inside his house, then?}{}{5}{}{55}{}
{55}{Perhaps you can use the same entrance he himself uses to slip in and out of his hovel. As to the nature of this entrance, I can't begin to guess.}{Perhaps you can use the same entrance he himself uses to slip in and out of his hovel. As to the nature of this entrance, I can't begin to guess.}{}{}{}{ru2135}
